{"id":"000W33","title":"Verloop","author":"Avelpuzzles","solvedCount":7,"difficulty":2,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-17T14:34:21+00:00","posted":"Heute, 06:27 Uhr","rules":"• Each row, column, and region must contain the digits 1-9 once each.\n• Cells separated by a Black dot must have a ratio of 1 to 2.\n• Cells separated by a White dot must have a difference of 1.\n• A loop must be drawn. The loop may only move orthogonally and must not touch itself, either orthogonally or diagonally.\n• Adjacent digits on the loop must have a difference of at least five.\n• A digit in a circle indicates how many of its up to eight surrounding cells must be on the loop.\n• A digit in a rectangle indicates how many of its up to eight surrounding cells must not be on the loop.\n• Circles and rectangles are not part of the loop.\n• The loop can't visit cells joined by a dots.\n• Solve in Sudokupad","solutionCode":"row 2","tags":["Sudoku","Kropki Pairs (Variante)","German Whispers (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/sdwbc8j4cp","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/sdwbc8j4cp","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-17T14:34:21+00:00"}